      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.68,
        "t": 755.71466,
        "r": 527.3687819999982,
        "b": 729.8029289281768
      },
      "content": "Set the mode to Handle X, move the turret head in the + direction of X-axis, and make it not to disturbed in Tail Stock (Special Accessory)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0522",
      "reading_order": 688,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.68,
        "t": 500.7156800000002,
        "r": 527.3547540000002,
        "b": 474.80394892817696
      },
      "content": "The differences between reference point position in Z-axis and the coordinate value of MACHINE become the grid shift amount."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0523",
      "reading_order": 689,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37948400000003,
        "t": 449.7158840000002,
        "r": 234.35492400000015,
        "b": 440.84416492817695
      },
      "content": "Input Running Distance"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0524",
      "reading_order": 690,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.67899800000004,
        "t": 432.6758720000002,
        "r": 397.30717799999934,
        "b": 423.80415292817696
      },
      "content": "Make the parameter change valid according to para. 1)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0525",
      "reading_order": 691,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.67899800000004,
        "t": 415.6959800000002,
        "r": 286.26353400000005,
        "b": 406.82426092817695
      },
      "content": "Calculate the running distance"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0526",
      "reading_order": 692,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.91839199999995,
        "t": 398.7160880000002,
        "r": 527.3747939999997,
        "b": 355.82446492817695
      },
      "content": "If the [MACHINE] coordinate is set to 377.268 and 332.754 for 380.000 in the X-axis and 330.000 in the Z-axis, the running distance of each axis will be calculated as follows."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0527",
      "reading_order": 693,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.91839199999995,
        "t": 347.7162920000002,
        "r": 419.86219799999986,
        "b": 338.84457292817694
      },
      "content": "X-axis distance = initial value + (380.000-377.268) X1000"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0528",
      "reading_order": 694,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 234.00021599999997,
        "t": 330.6762800000002,
        "r": 329.43971399999987,
        "b": 321.8045609281769
      },
      "content": "= 1000+2732 = 3732"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0529",
      "reading_order": 695,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.91839199999995,
        "t": 313.6963880000002,
        "r": 420.42632400000076,
        "b": 304.82466892817695
      },
      "content": "Z-axis distance = initial value + (330.000-322.754) x 1000"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0530",
      "reading_order": 696,
      "section": "1-3-1. Reference Point Adjusting Method 1",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 234.00021599999997,
        "t": 296.71649600000023,
        "r": 329.43971399999987,
        "b": 287.844776928177
      },
      "content": "= 1000+7246 = 8246"
    },
